    212 => "Local read before it is definitely assigned",
    213 => "End of a non-`void` function is reachable (for a `never` function too, type-system §15.3)",
    214 => "`break`/`continue` outside a loop",
    215 => "`return` with or without a value contradicts the return type, or `return` in a `never` function",
    216 =>
